==Characteristics==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Forest Octorok}}
Forest Octoroks are a type of [[Octorok]] that have adapted to live in forests. They hide underground and disguise themselves as shrubbery, jumping out if a person wanders close enough.<ref name="BotW Hyrule Compendium 2"/> If a Forest Octorok spots [[Link]], it will spit rocks at him from afar. Link can deflect these back at them by [[Blocking]] with any [[Shield]]. If Link is close enough, the Rock will hit the Forest Octorok after being deflected and instantly defeat it. A [[Perfect Guard]] will send the Rock flying back faster, letting Link kill them from farther away. If their shrubbery is cut, Forest Octoroks will pop out of the ground in confusion, leaving themselves open for an attack.

